---
export interface Props {
  hero: {
    title: string | null;
    subtitle: string | null;
    image: string | null;
  };
  contentBlocks: Array<{
    heading: string | null;
    text: string | null;
  }>;
}

const { hero, contentBlocks } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="about-page">
  <!-- First Hero Section - About NECSI -->
  <section class="hero-section about-hero">
    <div class="hero-background">
      <img src={hero.image} alt={hero.title || 'About NECSI'} />
    </div>
    <div class="hero-overlay">
      <div class="container">
        <h1 class="hero-title">{hero.title}</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">{contentBlocks[0]?.heading}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content Section 1 - About NECSI Text and Buttons -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="two-column-layout">
        <div class="main-content">
          <div class="about-text">
            <p class="paragraph">{hero.subtitle}</p>
            <p class="paragraph">
              NECSI develops complex systems science and its applications. Complex systems science 
              provides a unified approach to understanding the behavior of systems by studying the 
              interactions of their parts. This approach is mathematically based and applies across 
              physical, biological, social sciences, engineering, management, and medicine.
            </p>
            <p class="paragraph">
              NECSI's research areas include social policy, networks, agent-based modeling, chaos, 
              predictability, evolution, ecology, healthcare, military conflict, and more. NECSI 
              also conducts educational activities including classes, seminars, conferences, and 
              postdoctoral fellows.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="sidebar">
          <div class="button-group">
            <a href="#" class="cta-button">FACULTY</a>
            <a href="#" class="cta-button">AFFILIATES</a>
            <a href="#" class="cta-button">TEAM MEMBERS</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Second Hero Section - About Complex Systems -->
  <section class="hero-section complex-systems-hero">
    <div class="hero-background">
      <div class="network-pattern"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-overlay">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="hero-title">ABOUT COMPLEX SYSTEMS</h2>
        <div class="hero-text">
          <p class="hero-paragraph">
            Complex Systems is a new field of science discovering how parts of a system give rise 
            to its collective behaviors, and how the system interacts with its environment. Social 
            systems, the brain and weather are all examples of complex systems.
          </p>
          <p class="hero-paragraph">
            Complexity science helps us understand indirect effects and unintended consequences. 
            Pushing "here" often has effects "there" Because of interdependence. We see this in 
            social problems and ecological disasters caused by our own actions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content Section 2 - Where to start? -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="three-column-layout">
        <div class="book-section">
          <div class="book-cover">
            <div class="book-title">MAKING THINGS WORK</div>
            <div class="book-subtitle">SOLVING COMPLEX PROBLEMS IN A COMPLEX WORLD</div>
            <div class="book-author">YANEER BAR-YAM</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="book-description">
          <h3 class="section-title">Where to start?</h3>
          <p class="description-text">
            Making Things Work explains the ideas of complexity science and how we can use them 
            for the real world problems of:
          </p>
          <ul class="problem-list">
            <li>healthcare</li>
            <li>education</li>
            <li>military conflict</li>
            <li>ethnic violence and terrorism</li>
            <li>international development</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="book-buttons">
          <div class="button-group">
            <a href="#" class="cta-button">CONCEPT MAP</a>
            <a href="#" class="cta-button">VISUALIZATIONS</a>
            <a href="#" class="cta-button">ONLINE RESOURCES</a>
            <a href="#" class="cta-button">SIGNIFICANT POINTS</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</section>

<style>
  .about-page {
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #333333;
  }

  /* Hero Sections */
  .hero-section {
    position: relative;
    height: 400px;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .hero-background {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .hero-background img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .network-pattern {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: #0c1b3a;
    background-image: 
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 1px, transparent 1px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 1px, transparent 1px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 40% 60%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 100px 100px, 150px 150px, 200px 200px;
  }

  .hero-overlay {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .hero-overlay .container {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: white;
    text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: white;
    text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .hero-text {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero-paragraph {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: white;
    text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Content Sections */
  .content-section {
    padding: 4rem 0;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  /* Two Column Layout */
  .two-column-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  /* Three Column Layout */
  .three-column-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  /* Main Content */
  .main-content {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  }

  .about-text {
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .paragraph {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #333333;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  /* Book Section */
  .book-section {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .book-cover {
    width: 200px;
    height: 280px;
    background: #0c1b3a;
    color: white;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }

  .book-title {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .book-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .book-author {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* Book Description */
  .book-description {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #333333;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .description-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #333333;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .problem-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .problem-list li {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    color: #333333;
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .problem-list li::before {
    content: "♦";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #0c1b3a;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  /* Buttons */
  .button-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-button {
    display: block;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    background: #0c1b3a;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    background: #1a2f5a;
  }

  /* Responsive Design */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-section {
      height: 300px;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .two-column-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .three-column-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .container {
      padding: 0 1rem;
    }

    .content-section {
      padding: 2rem 0;
    }

    .book-cover {
      width: 150px;
      height: 210px;
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
    }

    .book-title {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .book-subtitle {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .book-author {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .hero-section {
      height: 250px;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
